Overview 
  - Phishing email analyzer. The project would focus on creating a Python tool used to analyze emails that seem suspicious. It will examine everything the email contains, from the header to the spelling and grammar used.   

- Besides creating a function analyzer tool, we want to be able to have the analysis state a risk score, as well as a small explanation of why the email seems fake. We will also test the tool with real emails as well to make sure it doesn’t falsely flag those as fake.  
